2026-09-23T07:24:14.1069561Z     Features
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1069652Z     --------
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1069731Z     
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1070198Z     - Detailed info on failing `assert statements <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/assert.html>`_ (no need to remember ``self.assert*`` names)
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1070281Z     
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1070374Z     - `Auto-discovery
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1070656Z       <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/goodpractices.html#python-test-discovery>`_
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1070758Z       of test modules and functions
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1070836Z     
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1071095Z     - `Modular fixtures <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/fixtures.html>`_ for
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1071260Z       managing small or parametrized long-lived test resources
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1071338Z     
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1071592Z     - Can run `unittest <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/unittest.html>`_ (or trial)
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1071686Z       test suites out of the box
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1071766Z     
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1071869Z     - Python 3.10+ or PyPy3
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1071941Z     
2026-09-23T07:24:14.1072409Z     - Rich plugin architecture, with over 1300+ `external plugins <https://docs.pytest.org/en/latest/reference/plugin_list.html>`_ and thriving community
